# text = Only let me know and feel that I have no deception to answer for on my side , and then , when he has heard what I have to say , let him act towards me as he will Leave it there to-night to-morrow may be cruel , and may make me say good-bye to it for ever Don't be afraid of me , Marian I may forget myself with an old friend like Mr . Gilmore , or with a dear sister like you , but I will not forget myself with Sir Percival Glyde I wish to speak to you , Sir Percival on a subject that is very important to us both .
